import { NAV_LINKS, TREATMENT_PAGES, PROVIDER, DIRECTIONS_URL, BOOKING_URL } from "../../data/site";
const path = "/treatments/microneedling-fareham/";
const title = "Microneedling in Fareham | Forever Young Beauty by Layla";
const description = "Microneedling in Fareham for uneven skin texture and certain acne scars. Learn about suitability, recovery and aftercare with Layla in Titchfield Common.";
const canonical = "https://foreveryoungbeautybylayla.co.uk/treatments/microneedling-fareham/";
const booking = BOOKING_URL;
const schema = {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","name":"Microneedling in Fareham","description":description,"url":canonical,"provider":PROVIDER,"areaServed":[{"@type":"Place","name":"Fareham, Hampshire"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Locks Heath, Hampshire"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Park Gate, Hampshire"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Titchfield, Hampshire"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Whiteley, Hampshire"}]};
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>{title}</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/><meta property="og:title" content={title}/><meta property="og:description" content={description}/><meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} /></head>
<body>
<header class="top"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Forever Young Beauty homepage"><strong>Forever Young Beauty</strong><span>by Layla</span></a><a class="corner-logo" href="/" aria-label="Return to homepage"><img src="/images/fyb-wordmark-1.png" alt="Forever Young Beauty logo" width="62" height="62" loading="eager" /></a><details class="menu"><summary aria-label="Open site menu"><span class="hamburger" aria-hidden="true">☰</span></summary><nav aria-label="Site navigation">{NAV_LINKS.map((l) => <a href={l.href} aria-current={l.href === path ? "page" : undefined}>{l.label}</a>)}</nav></details></header>
<main><section class="hero"><div class="inner"><p class="eyebrow">Forever Young Beauty by Layla · Titchfield Common</p><h1>Microneedling in Fareham</h1><p class="lead">Explore microneedling for uneven skin texture, fine lines and certain acne scars with Layla at Abshot Country Club, Titchfield Common, near Fareham and Locks Heath.</p><a class="button" href={booking}>View prices &amp; availability</a></div></section>
<div class="content"><section><h2>What is microneedling?</h2><p>Microneedling is a minimally invasive cosmetic treatment using fine, sterile needles to create controlled micro-injuries in the skin. This encourages the skin's natural repair response and processes involved in collagen production.</p></section>
<section><h2>What can it help with?</h2><p>Microneedling may improve the appearance of uneven texture, fine lines and some types of acne scarring. Outcomes vary between individuals, and some concerns may need multiple sessions or another approach.</p></section>
<section><h2>Microneedling for acne scars in Fareham</h2><p>Some people consider microneedling to help make certain <strong>depressed acne scars</strong> less noticeable. It does not erase scars, and different types of scarring respond differently. The appropriate approach depends on the scar type, your skin, any active breakouts and your medical history.</p><p>If you're exploring treatment for acne scarring near Fareham or Locks Heath, explain your concerns before booking so Layla can discuss the services she provides and whether they are suitable. Active inflamed acne or a skin infection may mean postponing treatment. Significant, raised or complex scarring may need assessment by a dermatologist rather than a standard beauty treatment.</p><p>For independent guidance, see the <a href="https://www.aad.org/public/diseases/acne/derm-treat/scars/treatment" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">American Academy of Dermatology's information on acne scar treatment</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>What to expect</h2><p>Your skin and relevant medical history should be assessed before treatment. Temporary redness, sensitivity or mild swelling can occur afterwards. Layla will explain suitability, recovery and aftercare.</p></section>
<section><h2>Is it right for me?</h2><p>Microneedling is not suitable for everyone. Active skin infections, certain skin conditions, medications or medical circumstances may mean treatment should be postponed or avoided.</p></section>
<section><h2>Preparing for microneedling</h2><p>Before booking, explain your current skincare routine, relevant medication and any active irritation or skin concerns. Layla can discuss whether an appointment is appropriate and what preparation she recommends. Avoid following generic online preparation advice in place of advice specific to your skin and treatment.</p></section>
<section><h2>Aftercare and recovery</h2><p>Temporary redness, sensitivity or swelling may occur after microneedling. The degree and duration vary. Follow the aftercare instructions given for your appointment, and ask when to resume your usual skincare products and activities. If you are comparing treatments for surface texture, <a href="/treatments/dermaplaning-fareham/">dermaplaning</a> and <a href="/treatments/caci-facials-fareham/">CACI facial toning</a> are other options to learn about, but they work differently and are not substitutes for microneedling.</p></section>
<section><h2>See the treatment in action</h2><p>Take a look at Layla's treatment video for a glimpse inside the salon.</p><video controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/videos/Microneedling_Highlight-poster.jpg" aria-label="Microneedling in Fareham treatment video"><source src="/videos/Microneedling_Highlight.mp4" type="video/mp4"/>Your browser does not support video.</video></section>
<section><h2>Microneedling questions</h2><h3>Can microneedling remove acne scars completely?</h3><p>No particular result can be guaranteed, and the aim is usually to improve the appearance of suitable scars rather than remove them completely. The type of acne scar matters, and treatment isn't right for every skin concern. Ask Layla about suitability and seek medical advice for complex scarring.</p><h3>Where is microneedling available near Fareham?</h3><p>Layla offers appointments at Abshot Country Club, Titchfield Common, close to Locks Heath, Park Gate, Whiteley and Fareham.</p><h3>How much downtime is there after microneedling?</h3><p>Redness, a warm or sunburn-like feeling, sensitivity and some swelling can occur after treatment. These often settle over several days, but recovery varies by person and treatment. Ask Layla for specific aftercare advice and when to resume your usual skincare and activities.</p><h3>Does microneedling suit every skin concern?</h3><p>No. Suitability depends on your skin, health and treatment goals. An assessment is important, particularly if you have active skin concerns.</p><h3>Where can I see prices and appointment times?</h3><p>Use the booking button to visit Layla’s own booking website and view current treatment options, prices and availability.</p></section>
<section class="trust"><h2>See what clients say</h2><p>Read verified customer feedback on Layla’s public Treatwell listing before choosing a treatment.</p><p><a href="https://www.treatwell.co.uk/place/forever-young-beauty-by-layla/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read verified Treatwell reviews →</a></p></section>
<section class="contact"><h2>Book your appointment</h2><p>Abshot Country Club, Little Abshot Road, Titchfield Common, Fareham, Hampshire PO14 4LN. Welcoming clients from Titchfield Common, Fareham, Locks Heath, Park Gate, Warsash and Stubbington, as well as nearby Whiteley.</p><a class="button" href={booking}>View treatment prices &amp; availability</a><p style="margin-top:.8rem;"><a href="/our-location/">How to find Layla at Abshot Country Club →</a></p></section>
<nav aria-label="Other treatments"><h2>Explore more treatments</h2><div class="links">{TREATMENT_PAGES.filter((t) => t.href !== path).map((t) => <a href={t.href}>{t.label} →</a>)}</div></nav></div></main>
<footer><a href="/">Forever Young Beauty by Layla</a> · Titchfield Common, Fareham</footer>
